{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ce4a96c1a606027a21444977a8ccb94c5c2359c97f50e488ebfadc27bca20fc", "ja": "（今日は百合子のPV撮影だ。天候にも恵まれて、\n準備は順調に進んでいる。さて、百合子の様子は……）", "zh": "（今天是百合子的PV拍摄。多亏天气不错，准备工作也在顺利进行。好了，百合子现在怎么样了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "0efd20490699a295e140cc3568ac3e28872be0b5aba32940bc1040f829350b8d", "ja": "ふふっ……ふふふっ……。", "zh": "呵呵……呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c64662175dc0bf4b372c91ea9fe53a2cfc8137aab2298e0aca9321c98fb41493", "ja": "お疲れ様、百合……。\nえっと……大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，百合……\n那个……你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "0b7f4c493e92b0c104bc36a4891ec7144ed0cfaeabb97263f4e914a8dddc2fbc", "ja": "ハッ！？　{$P$}さん！\nすみません、ちょっと今までのことを思い出してて。", "zh": "啊！？{$P$}先生！\n抱歉，我刚才在回想之前的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1004_p", "source_sha256": "74fa6326e1134c0069bfc8b4384e625b6bc4a6493c1df4aece039abcb5a8c134", "ja": "今までのこと？", "zh": "到目前为止的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "7d675d4990c6b9a265c979bb9c3a8e12a9639a0a0984e4078628b507d26827ee", "ja": "はい。小さい頃、母が本の読み聞かせをしてくれて……\nそれが、私と本の出会いでした。", "zh": "是的。小时候，妈妈会给我读书……\n那就是我与书籍的初次相遇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "08b439fddefda276baedc124a3ea805151aab771fea4d05196a7ffc7ce82948d", "ja": "それから、たくさん本を読んできました。本の中には、\n私の知らない世界が広がってて、ドキドキして……。", "zh": "从那以后，我读了很多书。书中展现着我所不知道的世界，让我心潮澎湃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a2561c83b4c6c95c8aad8015a5f6ad7065bc7198741536ab7dfd3bac3293e144", "ja": "そういえば、百合子に初めて会った時も、\n本の朗読をしている時だったな。", "zh": "说起来，第一次见到百合子的时候，她也正在朗读书呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "fbdcea41f3841f442ae30b80b6f311cef2337ed586ec74bf1d8895c245e4acfd", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。本のおかげでアイドルになって\n……私の物語は、新たな章に突入したんです！", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。多亏了书，我才能成为偶像，\n……我的故事也进入了全新的一章！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f503d85647eedf396c24d7967e2d80c29de8528f71e738fd8373446bf50477bd", "ja": "そうだな。アイドル活動が中心の話になるんだな。\nまあ、大変なことが多かったと思うけど……。", "zh": "是啊。接下来就是以偶像活动为主的故事了。\n不过，我想一定也经历了不少辛苦吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "8764e542c136f4a28eff516cfd50a81869ad0f043ca1e7b06b5f1f5f0423bc39", "ja": "あはは……。でも、苦難を乗り越えた分、\nちょっとは前進できてる気がします！", "zh": "啊哈哈……不过，在克服了那些艰难困苦之后，\n我感觉自己多少也有了些前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "cf273fb34d79c01da8448acbbe0e091ddc6bbbf439b758602da04081d8a485fe", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n私の物語、どれくらい進んだと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得，\n我的故事推进到哪一步了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1012_p", "source_sha256": "34dc4ea9876868e362944a5f92513673a6b56c8be1382c7921302f7dd4e56e3d", "ja": "うーん、どれくらいか……。\nそれは難しい質問だな。", "zh": "嗯……要说进展到什么程度啊……\n这个问题可真难回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "4bcec21008d22f650b46d28463018da65e49a4bf5a5584c5ab95cdaa6aee10b4", "ja": "えっ！　もしかして、1ページも進んでないですか？\n成長したと思ったのは、幻だったとか！？", "zh": "诶！难道连1页都还没读到吗？\n原来以为自己成长了，只是幻觉！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1014_p", "source_sha256": "34f96eeae2e1f0ac0e28990efa2ee260a58cc5f2a268bbb89252ca7377d37514", "ja": "違う違う！　そうじゃなくて……物語の主人公は、\n自分が何章まで来たかなんて知らないだろう？", "zh": "不是不是！我的意思是……故事的主人公，应该不会知道自己已经走到第几章了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fb28ac0af7d16b87c0a882aa71fe3a29564fcbbbe2b1dad67febdea52e5262da", "ja": "大事なのは、どこまで進んだかじゃなくて、\nどう進んでいきたいか、だと思うんだ。", "zh": "重要的是，不在于已经走到了哪里，\n而是在于想怎样走下去，我是这么认为的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "6c4f7dda01333537b8f6440d6e26cdfce5d56d7bbf37682cd1e4f244d55dcb4c", "ja": "どう進んでいきたいか……？\n物語の未来ってことですか？", "zh": "想要怎样继续前进……？\n是指故事的未来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7035dc2c7b23fde696d24f37d38e6b2baaec624fae7cdff07ecf5b1f51e11f93", "ja": "ああ。百合子の物語は、百合子にしか書けない。\nどんな話にしたいか、百合子が自由に想像するんだ。", "zh": "嗯。百合子的故事，只有百合子才能写出来。\n想写成什么样的故事，就由百合子自由地去想象吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "676e5f7ef6428fa1dfe5b806b0af946a8c541d1d39ad9a7c90c50cd287fb50c8", "ja": "私の未来を……新たなページを、想像する……！\nわぁ……なんだか、とってもワクワクしてきました！", "zh": "想象我的未来……想象崭新的篇章……！\n哇……不知怎么的，我突然变得特别期待起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "0d26a7c68e64bd9fe96e22f886d42e1d5e816d640205d6ec6d2329968cf8d70b", "ja": "そうですね。私の物語は、まだまだ続いていきます！\nこの果てしない空のように……！", "zh": "是啊。我的故事还会继续书写下去！\n就像这片无边无际的天空一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5e4b88360b03c9bf4f48e06d64017e1c349add52e1022b16eb55d17a13fe85c5", "ja": "ああ。……おっと、撮影が始まるみたいだな。\n準備はいいか、百合子？", "zh": "啊……哎呀，拍摄好像要开始了。准备好了吗，百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "90d0b0caafab683d90872e24b43d9194193ff3ad5a2dae00e2cbc28e408638a5", "ja": "もちろんです！　新しいページに綴る最初のお話は、\n今日の撮影についてですね。それじゃ、行ってきます♪", "zh": "当然没问题！新的一页里写下的第一个故事，\n就是今天的拍摄呢。那么，我出发啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0334_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2f6f550294ec3ea8dd6e90bbdfde5f994083365c193d5218c8aa3831e0d4fed4", "ja": "（未来には無限の可能性が広がっている。この先、\n百合子がどんな物語を綴るのか、そばで見届けよう）", "zh": "（未来拥有无限的可能性。接下来，就在一旁见证百合子会书写出怎样的故事吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
